                      </table>

                      <br />
                      <br />

                      This OTP is valid for
                      <strong>{{otp_expiry_minutes}} minutes</strong>. Please do
                      not share this code with anyone.
                      <br />
                      <br />

                      If you did not request a two-factor authentication reset,
                      you can safely ignore this email or contact the support
                      team.
                      <br />
                      <br />

                      <strong>
                        Best Regards,
                        <br />
                        Team
                        {{ProjectName}}
